{"id":"wb-7-1336","name":"八邦寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"八邦寺","text":"八邦寺（藏语：དཔལ་སྤུངས།，威利转写：Dpal-spungs，英语：Pelpung，或英语：Babang），又译为八蚌寺，是藏传佛教噶玛噶举派在康区的主寺，位于四川省德格县八帮乡，处于俄色拉山麓。1991年4月16日公布为四川省第三批文物保护单位。2013年3月5日列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%AB%E9%82%A6%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93290226,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93290226","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c3d8b0081307cd983f7e84df.jpg","title":"Palpung2014.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Palpung2014.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/Palpung2014.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"NoGhost","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"View of Palpung Monastery","width":320,"height":240}}